FYxc6dujtf9s4fQqXpoXo.jpg"},{"id":108476,"name":"Mikko Leppilampi","role":"Hannus","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5IIfMBNfERs4nwuJKFgikYlIwEo.jpg"},{"id":108474,"name":"Mikko Kouki","role":"Eemeli","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dwmRRfnB4tSl9x1cnpxOX2s5RQ7.jpg"},{"id":212815,"name":"Laura Birn","role":"Aada","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ppxbEAJffsdU7xHv6jxYs2VP8sy.jpg"},{"id":965718,"name":"Matti Ristinen","role":"Einari","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/l36h6FI8Vu9StT67m2yXALATHWv.jpg"},{"id":2123535,"name":"Antti Tuisku","role":"Mikko","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5SSZWJSZCWw2l68UyehJTuG6vIm.jpg"},{"id":2129866,"name":"Eeva Soivio","role":"Aleksandra","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uGJBARzGkT2Vnz9GeG3Cm3C19rY.jpg"},{"id":1517103,"name":"Pirjo Leppänen","role":"Hilla","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cRXz9jCYfSegEeHrVgoZf9e12S5.jpg"},{"id":936892,"name":"Saara Pakkasvirta","role":"Meeri","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/v0xmJVvUvGoLD2qksa5pPiR8OFT.jpg"},{"id":79757,"name":"Ville Virtanen","role":"Henrik","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8MdixCyOV8YRh9YySQwXPtGPwz5.jpg"},{"id":2874712,"name":"Oskari Heimonen","role":"Eemeli 11-vuotiaana"},{"id":2874713,"name":"Roi Ron","role":"Eemeli 5-vuotiaana"},{"id":2874714,"name":"Nella Siilasmaa","role":"Aada 9-vuotiaana"},{"id":2874715,"name":"Alpo Sipilä","role":"Mikko 9-vuotiaana"},{"id":1274699,"name":"Mauri Heikkilä","role":"Gideon"},{"id":2874717,"name":"Matti Rasilainen","role":"Hermanni"},{"id":2874718,"name":"Nora Syrjä","role":"Elsa"},{"id":2752488,"name":"Mikko Rokka","role":"Heino"},{"id":2267131,"name":"Lisa Sjöholm","role":"Laura"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Miracolo di una notte d'inverno","overview":"In Lapponia un bambino di nome Nikolas perde i genitori in un incidente. Gli abitanti del suo villaggio decidono di prendersi cura di lui, e Nikolas per ringraziarli costruisce dei regali di Natale per i bambini delle famiglie che lo hanno aiutato. La tradizione continua, fino a quando a 13 anni il ragazzo viene affidato a un vecchio falegname. Conquistato anche il suo affetto ricomincerà a costruire regali per tutti i bambini."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Christmas Story","overview":"Hundreds of years ago in Lapland, a little boy named Nikolas loses his family in an accident. The villagers decide to look after the orphaned boy together. Once a year - at Christmas - Nikolas moves to a new home. To show his gratitude, Nikolas decides to make toys for the children of the families as good-bye presents. Over the years, Nikolas's former adoptive families become many, and soon almost every house has presents on its doorstep on Christmas morning. At thirteen, Nikolas is sent to live and work with Iisakki, a grumpy old carpenter, who forbids Nikolas to continue making presents for Christmas. Gradually, however, Nikolas wins Iisakki's trust. Together they begin to look after the Christmas traditional that Nikolas has begun. When the aged Iisakki has to leave Nikolas and move away, the tradition of Christmas presents is once again at risk. Thankfully, Nikolas comes up with a solution that brings children joy every Christmas, even continuing to today."},{"language":"fi-FI","overview":"Joulutarina kertoo koskettavan tarinan perheensä menettäneestä Nikolas-pojasta. Nikolas kasvaa syrjäisessä Lapissa huolehtivaisten kyläläisten ottopoikana, mutta vasta erakoituneen puusepän Iisakin ankarassa opissa hänestä varttuu kaikkien rakastama maailman tunnetuin henkilö - joulupukki."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3DP5Yew8ct2G9RmEuKrVAZNkgRF.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kbPpf2RYMiijrjOfOyYgpFcNE90.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","i